        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Across our footprint, we are either the leading or one of the leading mobile providers and we continue to seek additional bandwidth to deliver our wide range of services to our customers and increase our high-speed coverage.",
        "start_character": 101105,
        "end_character": 101329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Across our regional footprint, we also provide services to business customers in multiple segments, from small and medium businesses to larger corporate and enterprise organizations including multi-national companies and governments.",
        "start_character": 36476,
        "end_character": 36709
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a mobile network provider, we are able to offer a full range of voice and data services, including value-added services.",
        "start_character": 26112,
        "end_character": 26235
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a network operator across most of our markets, we are able to offer a full range of voice and data services, including value-added, data-based and fixed-mobile converged services.",
        "start_character": 13942,
        "end_character": 14124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Except for Flow Sports and Flow 1 services, that we operate, in the Caribbean, and the Rush sports channel operated by a joint venture with Digicel, we license our programming and on-demand content through distribution agreements with third-party content providers, including broadcasters, leading cable networks and major Hollywood studios.",
        "start_character": 47525,
        "end_character": 47866
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In C&W, we have our most developed B2B business and are a leading provider of services in many of our markets, representing a significant portion of C&W’s revenue.",
        "start_character": 34776,
        "end_character": 34939
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Puerto Rico and Costa Rica we also offer telephony services over our respective networks.",
        "start_character": 34048,
        "end_character": 34140
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our core products and services, we meaningfully contribute to the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 119472,
        "end_character": 119582
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer attractive content packages tailored to particular markets and discounts for bundled services.",
        "start_character": 110238,
        "end_character": 110354
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer varying plans to meet customer needs and, similar to our mobile services, we use our telephony bundle options with our digital video and internet services to help promote our telephony services and flat rate offers are standard.",
        "start_character": 113999,
        "end_character": 114249
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we use our bundled offers with our high-speed internet services to gain mobile subscribers where possible.",
        "start_character": 101521,
        "end_character": 101640
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001712184-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001712184-26-000023-a83a476445ae7eec",
        "accession_number": "0001712184-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In all of our markets, we also compete with VoIP operators offering services across broadband lines and OTT telephony providers, such as WhatsApp.",
